---
title: Sweet & Sour Porkchops
author: Marge Arntson
category: Casseroles
cook time: 1 hour 45 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@pork chops
@salt
@pepper
@brown sugar{0.5%cup}
@chopped onion{0.5%cup}
@ketchup{0.5%cup}
@vinegar{6%Tbsp}
@Worcestershire sauce{2%Tbsp}

Put chops in large flat pan, salt and pepper. Boil in saucepan: brown sugar, chopped onion, ketchup, vinegar, and Worcestershire sauce. Pour over chops and bake at 375 degrees for 1 hour and 45 minutes. Uncover the last 30 min.
